I'm almost totally done with the CLL draft; I don't expect anything
significant to change.  So if you want to review it before
publication, the current draft is at http://vrici.lojban.org/~rlpowell/media/public/cll_prince_2015-10-05.pdf

The HTML version of same is at
http://vrici.lojban.org/~rlpowell/media/public/cll_nochunks_2015-10-05/
, although that's not directly relevant.

Ideally, issues would be added at
https://github.com/lojban/cll/issues , but email is fine too.

If you have bikeshed comments (i.e. comments on the overall visuals
and so on), please post them to the main mailing list.  I won't be
changing the visuals significantly unless there's overwhelming
community support for a change.

